# PHASE ORCHESTRATION V1.7.1

> **Purpose**: Manage the 9-phase conversational workflow that turns a customer use case into an executive-ready HLD + Supporting Doc + per-flow Diagrams + Refinement Log.
> **Enforcement**: See `@02_Mandatory_Stop_Points.mdc`

