| **4B** | **§6.5 How This Solves Your Problems** — panel-friendly subset table (top pains × persona × how-we-solve-it × component refs); _"Coverage: N/M stated pains addressed"_ summary line | **Appendix A Coverage Matrix (Full)** — A.1 Pain → Component (bidirectional) + A.2 Component → Pain with future-enabler tags |
| **4C** | **§11 Success Metrics & KPIs** — 3-tier tables (11.1 Business / 11.2 Operational / 11.3 Technical) with Baseline + Target + Window + Owner | **§10 Measurement & Observability Strategy** (skeleton + per-KPI rows in §10.1 Instrumentation Plan); stub `KPI_Baselines_v1.md` listing TBD-baseline KPIs |

For each sub-stop: present analytical content in chat → get approval → write to file via targeted `edit` on the section marker → verify → checkpoint.

**After Phase 4C approval, Phase 4 (overall) is COMPLETE — proceed to Phase 5.**

