## PHASE 5: ADVERSARIAL PERSONA REFINEMENT

> **v1.3.0 addition.** Stress-test the Phase-4-finalized solution against simulated panel personas BEFORE HLD generation. Per-persona loop with HITL stops + final consolidation stop. **Full operational spec** (library, tiers, Improvement Opportunity Schema, RGV, termination, Phase 4 delta rules): **`lib/docs/phase-5-persona-refinement-spec.md`** — read before executing.

**Activation contract:** Phase 4C `COMPLETED`. Entry artifact = Solution v1 (Phase 4 finalist + 4A/4B/4C outputs).

**Persona engagement order** (deterministic — spec §2.4):
1. Phase-0 panel personas (panel order from state)
2. Industry overlay if `industryVertical` matches healthcare / financial-services / retail / manufacturing / public-sector (spec §2.2)
3. Generic library: CFO → CISO → Skeptic-Architect → Vendor-Burned-Buyer → Compliance-Officer

**Per-persona loop (5 tiers per persona):**
1. **GENERATE** 5 questions — Basic → Intermediate → Advanced → Expert → Adversarial (templates: spec §3)
2. **ANSWER** each using v_n; **VERIFY** against catalog; trigger live research only on uncertainty (D6); score Confidence
3. **DECIDE** verdict per Q: ✅ KEEP / ⚠️ IMPROVE / ❌ DISCARD-WITH-NOTE (rules: spec §5)
4. **STOP — Per-Persona Checkpoint** (`@02_Mandatory_Stop_Points.mdc` Stop #9)

**End-of-loop consolidation:** if ≥1 HIGH-impact IMPROVE → Round 2 for affected personas only (max 2 rounds, D5; selection: spec §9.3) → generate v1→v2 diff → **STOP — Final Consolidation** (Stop #10).

**Phase 4 Delta Re-Validation (D7, spec §8):** component add/remove → 4B delta; capability/geography/edition change → 4A delta; KPI change → 4C delta. Delta runs do NOT trigger Phase 4 stops; recorded in `Refinement_Log.md` §6.

**Termination (D5):** Normal (all personas done) / Max-rounds (2 completed; remainder → Risk Register) / User-locked-early (`lock now` + mandatory 1-line rationale).

**RGV Cycle:** READ Phase 4 finalist + 4B + 4C + persona list (P) → GENERATE P × 5 questions [+ Round 2 subset], per Q produce A + verification + verdict + opportunity → VERIFY: 5 tiers per persona, every IMPROVE has full Schema (spec §4), every DISCARD has deferral target, every delta has updated state, v2 diff reconciles → FIX gaps before checkpoint.

**Outputs:** `Refinement_Log.md` (from `templates/Refinement-Log-template.md`); state updates to `refinementLog`, `personasEngaged[]`, `improvementsApplied[]`, `improvementsRejected[]`, `currentRefinementRound`, `terminationTrigger`; delta updates to `feasibilityMatrix` / `coverageMatrix` / `kpis` if Phase 4 re-validation triggered.

**Artifact Writes (Phase 5 — Progressive Documentation v2):**
- `Refinement_Log.md` — full per-persona Q&A audit trail per template format
- **APPEND DELTAS** (not full rewrites) to progressively-built HLD/Supporting sections when Phase 5 OPPs change them:
  - HLD §3 (if new persona quotes surface — rare; usually Phase 1 has all of them)
  - HLD §6.5 (if Phase 4B delta re-validation adds/removes pain→component mappings)
  - HLD §11 (if Phase 4C delta adds new KPIs — e.g., cliff metrics, composite indices)
  - Supporting §3.5 (if Phase 4A delta re-validates capabilities)
  - Supporting §10 (if Phase 4C delta adds KPI rows that need instrumentation)
  - Supporting Appendix A (if Phase 4B delta changes coverage)
- **Append Appendix B Refinement Summary** to `Supporting.md` — B.1 Personas Engaged · B.2 v1→v2 Diff · B.3 Phase 4 Delta Outcomes · B.4 Termination & Confidence

**Checkpoint 5 (final consolidation):** Solution v2 hardened; refinement log written; Phase 4 deltas reconciled; HLD/Supporting deltas appended. STOP.

