## PHASE 7: SUPPORTING LLD DOC CONSOLIDATE & POLISH (Progressive Documentation v2)

> **v1.7.0 CRITICAL REDEFINITION:** Phase 7 is **consolidate-and-polish**. By this phase, `Supporting.md` already contains §1.2 (Phase 1), §3 (Phase 2A/2B), §2 (Phase 3 + 4 prelim), §3.5 (Phase 4A), Appendix A (Phase 4B), §10 skeleton (Phase 4C), Appendix B + any deltas (Phase 5). Phase 7 generates the **remaining sections** + KPI Baselines artifact + polishes the whole document.

**Phase 7 Task List:**

**Step 1 — RE-READ progressively-built Supporting Doc.** Confirm §1.2, §2, §3, §3.5, §10 skeleton, Appendix A, Appendix B are present and reflect all Phase 5 deltas. List which `<!-- SECTION: X -->` markers are still placeholders.

**Step 2 — Generate §1 Reviewer Summary.** 1-paragraph restatement targeting the reviewer: what HLD proposes + key assumptions + where risks are managed.

**Step 3 — Generate §2 Design Rationale — Component by Component.** For each Solution v2 component (typically 8-12): Role / Why chosen (evidence cite) / Alternatives considered (2-3 + why rejected) / Tradeoff accepted.

**Step 4 — Generate §3 Accelerator Selection Matrix.** Y/N evaluation × industry accelerators (Healthcare, FS, Retail, Mfg, Utilities, Consumer Goods, Salesforce OMS, SAP) with customization ratios.

**Step 5 — Generate §4 Risk Register + §4.5 NFR Compliance Matrix.** §4 = 3-5 risks per category × 5 categories (Technical, Delivery, Org, Security/Compliance, Commercial) with likelihood/impact/mitigation. §4.5 = 8 NFR categories with target + how-met + components-responsible + gap.

**Step 6 — Generate §5 Assumption Log + §6 Gap Register.** §5 = every ⚠️ ASSUMPTION across Phases 0-5 with impact + validation path. §6 = items that couldn't be confirmed after 3 attempts.

**Step 7 — Generate §7 Phased Roadmap (detailed) + §8 Talk Track + §9 Cross-Ref.** §7 = 0-90 / 90-180 / 180-365 day horizon detail (workstreams + decisions). §8 = per-HLD-section talk-track tips. §9 = HLD-section → Supporting-section back-pointer table.

**Step 8 — POLISH Appendix C (Per-Flow Diagrams overflow)** _(NEW in v1.7.0)_: if Phase 6 capped at 4 flows but the architecture has additional flows, write Appendix C as a brief table listing the deferred flows with one-line descriptions and a pointer back to the cross-reference in `diagrams.md`.

**Step 9 — Generate `KPI_Baselines_v1.md`** — separate artifact listing every KPI requiring 90-day pre-launch baseline capture; signed off by executive sponsor. Promotes the stub created in Phase 4C to the final signed-off form.

**Step 10 — POLISH the progressively-built sections** (§2 Design Rationale alignment with §3.5 Feasibility, §10 instrumentation completeness vs HLD §11, Appendix A coverage entries vs §6.5).

**Step 11 — Update generation footer** of Supporting Doc: `Authored with: Cloud Success Architect Agent v1.7.0 | {generation-date}`.

> See `templates/Supporting-Doc-template.md` for canonical structure (incl. §3.5 Feasibility, §4.5 NFR, §10 Measurement, Appendix A Coverage Full, Appendix B Refinement Summary, Appendix C Diagram Overflow if applicable).

**RGV Cycle:** READ progressively-built Supporting sections (§1.2, §2, §3, §3.5, §10 skeleton, Appendix A, Appendix B) + Phase 4A+5 feasibility + Phase 4B+5 coverage + Phase 4C+5 KPIs + Phase 5 refinement log + Phase 6 HLD components + `finalist.capabilityFlows[]` count → GENERATE remaining 9 sections (§1, §3 accelerator-matrix, §4, §4.5, §5, §6, §7, §8, §9) + KPI Baselines artifact + optional Appendix C → VERIFY: §3.5 has every feasibility entry (incl. Phase 5 deltas), §4.5 has 8 NFR rows, §10 has 1 row per HLD §11 KPI, Appendix A has 100% of coverage entries, Appendix B summarizes refinement log, `KPI_Baselines_v1.md` lists all TBD-baseline KPIs → FIX any missing rows from source phase output.

**Checkpoint 7:** Supporting Doc consolidated (all sections filled) + KPI Baselines artifact final + optional Appendix C if diagrams.md overflowed. Ask user to review. STOP.

