## STATE FILE UPDATE PROTOCOL (MANDATORY)

Update state file after EVERY phase completion. After user approves a phase:
1. Update `currentPhase` → next phase
2. Set completed phase status to `"COMPLETED"`
3. Add `completedAt` timestamp
4. Append any new entries to `assumptionLog[]` / `gapRegister[]`
5. For Phase 4A/4B/4C: also write the corresponding object (`feasibilityMatrix` / `coverageMatrix` / `kpis`); see `lib/docs/state-schema-reference.md` for per-phase update map.
6. For Phase 5 per-persona stops: append to `refinementLog.personasEngaged[?name].rounds[?round].questions[]`; for delta runs append to `refinementLog.deltaRuns[]` and update affected `feasibilityMatrix` / `coverageMatrix` / `kpis`; for final consolidation set `refinementLog.endedAt` + `solutionVersionPost`.

